App-set layouts folder

The layout editor saves its layouts in Documents/controller_layouts,
which the app cannot change. An app that keeps its own files in a
folder structure of its own needs them elsewhere.

New public LayoutExporter.directory: the layouts' folder, set by the
app before the controller view appears; unset, Documents/
controller_layouts as before.

Upstream: not submitted.

diff -ru a/Sources/Melo-Controller/Layout/LayoutManager.swift b/Sources/Melo-Controller/Layout/LayoutManager.swift
